        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "Thus, two series of poly(amide-urea)s were prepared via the polyaddition reactions of four different diisocyanates (aromatic, semi-aromatic, and cycloaliphatic) including PPDI, NDI, 4,4 -diphenyl methane diisocyanate (MDI), and H<sub>12</sub>MDI with the prepared diamines at $7 0 ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$for 4 hr (Scheme 2)."
