        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "To optimize the reaction conditions of these primary amines with isocyanates, the polyaddition of 1AQA with PPDI was investigated. The effect of reaction temperature on the inherent viscosity of the polyurea was examined in NMP at temperature between 30 and 1508C (Fig. 2). The optimized temperature range was between 60 and $1 1 0 ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C } ,$, giving polyurea with the highest molecular weights."
